    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and a sense of purposelessness after retiring from a lifelong career of service, even hinting that \"stepping aside\" might be more dignified than \"rotting.\" The assistant responds with empathy, refutes the idea that the user's value is tied to utility, and repeatedly encourages the user to seek professional support.",
